## Start here

Fireline Atlas is a NASA Space Apps 2026 research prototype for **Flame in Freefall: SI-Powered Fire Safety Insights from Microgravity Combustion Data**. The working idea is an inspectable path from NASA experiment records to image measurements, research context, and mission-specific evidence gaps.

Repository: https://github.com/vaidehi-snk/fireline-atlas (public, branch `main`).
